<title>USA: Trade estimates for US Census Bureau oilmill data.</title>
<headline>Trade estimates for US Census Bureau oilmill data.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade estimates for the monthly U.S. Census Bureau oilmill report set for release on Tuesday, June 24, at 0800 EDT (1200 GMT).</p>
<p>Note: Estimates for soymeal stocks include meal/cake and soy millfeed stocks covering the month of May 1997.</p>
<p>				  Range	   Average   Prev. Month</p>
<p> Soybean crushings-X   109,400-110,500  109,900   114,757</p>
<p> Soymeal stocks-Y	295,000-333,000  315,250   280,058</p>
<p>--</p>
<p>SOYOIL FACTORY AND WAREHOUSE STOCKS:</p>
<p>    Total-Z		  2,090-2,120	2,112    2,164</p>
<p>(X=1,000 Bu, Y=Short Tons, Z=Mln Lbs)</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720))</p>
</text>
